NOTE[en]="Symbols:#.. Data not available or too uncertain for presentation, or subject to secrecy.#* Preliminary data#Data on roundwood drain in 2014-2023 revised on 24th April 2025.#Annual increment; National Forest Inventory (NFI), Luke. Increment is here the av"
"erage annual increment during the last five growing periods preceding the inventory moment.#During 2008-2015 energywood for heat and power plants is recorded based on amounts used in energy production and in other years based on harvesting volumes.#Fuelw"
"ood of small houses is recorded based on the volume of use.#The statistics for 2024 have been corrected 14.4.2026. The national total roundwood removals increased by 0.952 million m³ (+1.3%), and the total drain increased by 1.091 million m³ (+1.2%).";
